FoamFile { version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object turbulenceProperties; }
// The TURBULENT twin of validation/liqBox: same duct, same water, same walls. kEpsilon is what the
// squareBendLiq tutorial runs, and it is the default here; the gate also runs kOmegaSST on the same
// fields, because nothing about a liquid thermo is specific to one closure and a fix that only one of
// them exercised would be a patch for a tutorial rather than a port. Both 0.orig/epsilon and
// 0.orig/omega ship for that reason; each model reads only its own.
simulationType RAS;
RAS
{
    RASModel        kEpsilon;
    turbulence      on;
    printCoeffs     on;
}
